    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d196">

                <pb facs="0283" n="179" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg179"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/1397.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé
                            d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-04-27T10:00:00+08:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 27, 1913; 10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Quintuple reorganization loan signed this morning over protest of certain
                    senators who claim that approval by the Assembly is necessary and who threaten
                    to boycott the banks.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Williams</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
